## TypeScript Source Inventory Contract

The TypeScript source inventory contract keeps every `TypeScript/**/*.ts` source file listed in `Tools/check/adlaire-design-contracts.json` and check-covered by one of the source registries: the CSS compiler registry, generated JavaScript pair contract, UI interaction contract metadata, UI component contract metadata, or editor runtime module registry.

## CSS Target Manifest Contract

The CSS target manifest contract keeps `TypeScript/CSS/manifest.ts` `CSS_TARGETS`, generated CSS output files, CSS target metadata, first-line headers, public CSS order, sample loading, and documentation synchronized. JSON `tokenCategories` keeps token category boundaries synchronized with `TypeScript/CSS/tokens.ts`. Token targets are `Tokens/colors.css`, `Tokens/typography.css`, `Tokens/spacing.css`, `Tokens/layout.css`, `Tokens/motion.css`, `Tokens/layer.css`, `Tokens/breakpoints.css`, `Tokens/surface.css`, `Tokens/status.css`, and `Tokens/effects.css`. Public UI targets are `UI/adlaire.css`, `UI/base.css`, `UI/grid.css`, `UI/layout.css`, `UI/components.css`, `UI/site.css`, `UI/forms.css`, `UI/content.css`, `UI/utilities.css`, and `UI/compat-agws.css`. Editor UI CSS output is `EditorUI/wysiwyg.css`.

## Development Configuration And Output Placement Contracts

The Development configuration contract keeps development, build, generation, check, and release-check settings JSON-only and rejects YAML as a technology selection for those scopes. It also rejects npm, Node, npm-compatible package manager files, and external frontend build tool configuration.

The Generated output placement contract keeps repository CSS and JavaScript files limited to the generated output paths in the JSON inventory, plus the sample-support files `Samples/design/sample.css` and `Samples/design/sample.js`.

The Source/output/sample boundary contract keeps TypeScript sources, generated CSS/JavaScript outputs, and sample-support material in their separate repository roles.

## Generated JavaScript Pair Contract

| Source | Generated output |
| --- | --- |
| `TypeScript/UI/components.ts` | `UI/components.js` |
